<title>UK: Copenhagen sets 100 mln Swiss franc seven-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Copenhagen sets 100 mln Swiss franc seven-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Union Bank of Switzerland.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF COPENHAGEN</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    30.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.80    PAY DATE    30.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STANDARD  LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K)  FIVE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
